---
/**
 * The drifting glow behind the page. Fixed, so it never scrolls and every
 * panel above it can use a flat translucent fill instead of a live blur.
 *
 * The gradient stack lives in `aurora-field` in utilities.css; everything else
 * about where it sits is here.
 */
---

<div
  class="aurora-field motion-safe:animate-drift pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-[-10vw] inset-y-[-20vh] z-[-1]"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
</div>
